{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2019-11-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'MONTEREY RESEARCH FILES PATENT INFRINGEMENT SUIT AGAINST QUALCOMM INCORPORATED', 'text': 'IPVALUE MANAGEMENT INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY MONTEREY RESEARCH LLC HAS FILED A PATENT INFRINGEMENT ACTION AGAINST QUALCOMM INCORPORATED AND RELATED ENTITIES IN DELAWARE DISTRICT COURT. THE ACTION INVOLVES EIGHT MONTEREY PATENTS COVERING A VARIETY OF INNOVATIVE TECHNOLOGIES, INCLUDING CIRCUIT DESIGN AND SEMICONDUCTOR MANUFACTURING.'}